  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evalutation TF Social LTU</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering TF Social LTU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med utv&#xe4;rderingen &#xe4;r att unders&#xf6;ka relevans, effekter, kostnadseffektivitet och uth&#xe5;lligheten i det Sida finansierade st&#xf6;det till projektet lokalt Socialt n&#xe4;tverk i Litauen. Konsulterna ska utv&#xe4;rdera vart och ett av de 14 pilot-center som uppr&#xe4;ttats och unders&#xf6;ka framg&#xe5;ng, kostnadseffektivitet, relevans etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thye purpose of the evaluation is to acquire knowledge about the relevance, effects, impact, cost-effectiveness and sustainability of Swedish support so far as well as to analyse lessons to be learned. The team of consultants shall provide an evaluation of each one of the 14 pilot-centres and assess their success relevance and  sustainability with regard to initial objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
